{
    "plugins": [
        "@semantic-release/commit-analyzer",
        [
            "@semantic-release/release-notes-generator",
            {
                "preset": "conventionalcommits",
                "writerOpts": {
                    "headerPartial": "## pkl-systemd {{#if isPatch~}} <small>\n  {{~/if~}} {{version}}\n  {{~#if title}} \"{{title}}\"\n  {{~/if~}}\n  {{~#if date}} ({{date}})\n  {{~/if~}}\n  {{~#if isPatch~}} </small>\n  {{~/if}}\n\nThis is the {{version}} release of pkl-systemd - declarative systemd unit configuration using Pkl.\n\n## Installation\n\n### Option 1: PklProject Dependencies (Recommended)\n\nAdd to your `PklProject` dependencies:\n\n```\ndependencies {\n    [\"systemd\"] = \"package://pkl.declix.org/pkl-systemd@{{version}}\"\n}\n```\n\nThen import with short syntax:\n\n```pkl\nimport \"@systemd/Service.pkl\"\nimport \"@systemd/Timer.pkl\"\n// etc.\n```\n\n### Option 2: Direct Import\n\n```pkl\n// Service unit\namends \"package://pkl.declix.org/pkl-systemd@{{version}}#/Service.pkl\"\n\n// Timer unit\namends \"package://pkl.declix.org/pkl-systemd@{{version}}#/Timer.pkl\"\n\n// Socket unit\namends \"package://pkl.declix.org/pkl-systemd@{{version}}#/Socket.pkl\"\n\n// Mount unit\namends \"package://pkl.declix.org/pkl-systemd@{{version}}#/Mount.pkl\"\n\n// Other unit types: Target, Path, Swap, Automount, Slice, Scope\n```\n\n"
                }
            }
        ],
        [
            "@semantic-release/exec",
            {
                "publishCmd": "just release ${nextRelease.version}"
            }
        ],
        [
            "@semantic-release/github",
            {
                "assets": [
                    "dist/**"
                ]
            }
        ]
    ],
    "tagFormat": "${version}",
    "preset": "conventionalcommits"
}